<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- DE DRIE H1 NET SLIGHTLY UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE- DE DRIE H1 NET SLIGHTLY UP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.51 vs   0.45</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.61 vs   0.55</p>
<p>    Turnover				 7.4  vs   8.4</p>
<p>NOTE - De Drie Electronics NV said it expected profits in</p>
<p>the second half of 1997 to be about equal to those posted in the</p>
<p>first half of the year. In 1996, the company posted full-year</p>
<p>net profit of 1.31 million guilders.</p>
<p>De Drie previously said it expected 1996 profits to remain</p>
<p>steady.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
